WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Start with Xavier’s email. Open Xavier’s email on your iPhone. Find the Wondercase app link. Keep Wi-Fi or mobile data on.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Open the app link. Tap the app link once. If it opens in Safari, continue to the app page. If it opens in another browser or inside email, follow the next steps.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
If needed: copy the link. Return to the email. Touch and hold the app link, then choose Copy Link or Copy. The link is now ready to paste.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Open Safari. Find Safari, the blue compass icon. Tap it. Use Safari for this iPhone installation walkthrough.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Paste the app address. Tap Safari’s address bar. Touch and hold inside it, then tap Paste and Go. If you see Paste instead, tap Paste, then Go.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Check the journey page. Wait for Wondercase to load. You should see the journey title. If the app was already open in Safari, start here.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Find the Share button. Tap Share: a square with an upward arrow. Depending on Safari’s layout, first tap the Page Menu, then Share.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Expand the Share sheet. Swipe upward on the Share sheet to reveal more actions. Look below the row of app icons for Add to Home Screen.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Tap Add to Home Screen. Tap Add to Home Screen. If it is missing, scroll to Edit Actions, then add the Add to Home Screen action.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Check the app options. Keep the suggested name Wondercase. If Open as Web App appears, leave it switched on. Older iPhones may not show that switch.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Tap Add. Tap Add in the upper-right corner. Wait for the new icon to be placed on this iPhone’s Home Screen.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Find your new app icon. Return to the Home Screen: swipe up from the bottom, or press the physical Home button. Swipe between pages to find Wondercase.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Open your journey. Tap the new app icon. Use it each day instead of finding the email again. Travelers do not need Xavier’s TD Login. Keep internet on for current updates.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:06.000
If you need a little help. Cannot find the icon? Swipe down on the Home Screen and search its name. If installation did not finish, reopen the link in Safari and repeat Share → Add to Home Screen.
